        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "Barth syndrome (BTHS) is an inborn error of phospholipid metabolism characterized by dilated cardiomyopathy (DCM) skeletal myopathy neutropenia growth delay and organic aciduria."
        },
